  "title": "萬千花蕊慈母悲哀 諺文歌詞",
  "type": "post",
  "date": "2025-12-09T16:56:43+08:00",
  "modified": "2026-10-21T14:59:24+08:00",
  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">빤<ruby style=\"position: relative\">쳰<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">훼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뤼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 주<ruby style=\"position: relative\">뾰<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">비<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">애<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kkUWlcjmOew?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">下晡<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">에버ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一个人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">짇에랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">厝內<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">추`래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    e-pôr, jit-e-láng tiàm-chù-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">西北雨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">새ˉ박ˆ허ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">沃澹<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">악ˆ담-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">窗外<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">탕ˉ꽈ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">衫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">살ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sāi-pâk-hōr, âk-tam-thāng-goā’e sâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">外口<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽈ᄏᅷ`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶未<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">얗ˆ쀄-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">轉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">등`</rt></ruby>’래\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goa-khàu’e láng yâh-bue-tǹg’lai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">慐慐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">껑껑ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">단`</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">慐慐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">껑껑-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">꺟-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一支<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇기ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雨傘<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">허솰</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gong-gōng lêh-tàn, gong-gong-giah-jit-kī-hor-soa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幾若擺<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">귀ˆ나배`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">睏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쿤`-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">去<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    wi-lì, kûi-na-pài khùn-boe-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">全世界<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">좐세`개</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">揣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">췌-</rt></ruby>뾔둏<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">形影<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">혱얄`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    joan-sè-kai, chue-boe-tioh-lì’e hieng-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">凡勢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">환세</rt></ruby>,</span> 에<ruby style=\"position: relative\">당<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>가<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">放捒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">방`삭</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hoan-se, e-tàng-ka̰-lì pàng-sak\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">氣身惱命<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">키`신ˉ로ˆ먀ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">哪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.3em\">나ˋ</rt></ruby> 에<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">要<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">ᄋᆤ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">緊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">긴`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khì-sīn-lô-miā, goà nà e-lông-bo-yau bo-kìn\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">쟈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">規<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">暝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">메ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">電火<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뎬훼`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">閃爍<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샴ˆ싷</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tiàm-jiâ kūi-mé, khoà̰-tien-huè siâm-sih\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">쟈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等待<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">단ˆ태ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拍<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">팧ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뽀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà tiàm-jiâ tân-thāi, phâh-bó’khi-e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">厝內<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">추`래ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샬ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聲聲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˉ샬ˆ</rt></ruby> 듸<ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">吼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄒᅷ`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thiā̰-chù-lāi’e siâ̰, siā̰-siâ̰ ti-lêh-hàu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’레 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">踅<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">思念<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">火燒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훼ˆ쇼ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">房間<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">방곙ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà sêh’le sêh’khi, sū-liām huê-siō-pang-kiêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">開<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">轉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">등`</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">래<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    boe-khûi’e huê, bo-bêh-tǹg’lài-e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">美麗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> 앟 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">슐-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">當時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">덩ˉ시ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">꺟-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">懸<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">괠-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">旗仔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">기아`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bî-lē’e lì, ah siṵ-tioh-lì hît-tōng-sí, giah-koa̰i-lì’e ki-à\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路邊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">러빌ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">話<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">웨ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">滿<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뫄ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">街路<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">괴ˉ러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">紛飛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훈ˉ휘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lor-pḭ̂’e wē, moâ-koē-lōr hōr hūn-hûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時代<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">시대</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變化<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">볜`화</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">孤單<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一个人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">짇에랑ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">믕-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby> 야음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">捌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">빧</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-tai’e pièn-hoa, kōr-toâ̰’e goâ-jit-e-láng, mng-thḭ̂ ya-m-bat\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">手內<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">츄ˆ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥物<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뽀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chiû-lāi siâ̰-mîh lông-bó\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">只<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">賰<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">춘ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby>허<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jî-chūn-goâ-bêh-hor-lì’e ai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">血<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">휗</rt></ruby> 우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">肉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">빻</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    u-hueh u-bah’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">煞<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쇃ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">下落不明<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.5em\">헤롷붇ˆ뼹ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    soâh-he-loh-pût-biéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    가<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">記持<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">기`디ˊ</rt></ruby>’앟, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">囥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">킁`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心內<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ka̰-lì’e kì-tí’ah, khǹg-ti-goà’e sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">騎<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">캬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">白馬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">벻뻬`</rt></ruby>’앟, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">걀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khia-lì’e peh-bè’ah, kia̰-lî-bêh-kiá̰’e lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">吹<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">췌ˆ</rt></ruby>’래, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落塗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롷터ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">點<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">댬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一欉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇장-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">香<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">휼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">祈求<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">기규ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hông chuê’lai, huê loh-thór, tiâm-jit-jang-hiṵ̂ ki-kiú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">南無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">나머-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">觀世音<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">관ˉ세`임ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">菩薩<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">퍼삳</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    na-mor-koān-sè-īm-phor-sat\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若準<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">나준ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">算<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">승`-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">悲劇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">비ˉ격ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    na-jûn-kông-lì, sǹg-tioh-jît-chût-pī-kiôrk\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>에<span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看顧<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">콸`거</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">煞<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쇃</rt></ruby>’롷래 이<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">頭前<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄐᅷ졩-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">逝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">좌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歹行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">팰ˆ걀ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì kâm-e-khoà̰-kor, soah’loh-lai i-thau-jieng-hît-joa-phâ̰i-kiá̰’e lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢中<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빵뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">沓沓仔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">ᄃᅷᇂᄃᅷᇂ아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bang-tiông’e goà, khoà̰-lì tauh-tauh-â-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">牽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">칸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">亡魂<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뻥훈ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> 우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一工<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做伙<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">조`훼`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">轉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">등`</rt></ruby>’킈 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">个<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">所在<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">서ˆ재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khān-lì’e bong-hún, u-jit-kâng làn jò-huè tǹg’khi hît-e-sôr-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">蔫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">롄ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby> (<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">規<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˉ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà liên’khi-e ai (kūi-lōr lông-sī)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">恬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">댬ˉ</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kâh-lì tiām’khi-e sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">제<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">烏暗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">어ˉ암`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時代<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">시대</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ti-jē-ōr-àm-si-tai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby>우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">緣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">옌ˊ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">分<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">훈ˉ</rt></ruby> (<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">겅`</rt></ruby>’춛)\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-u-yén bo-hūn (siṵ-bêh-kòng’chut)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">샤ˆ-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">了<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄅᆤ`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">批<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">풰ˆ</rt></ruby> (<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">奈何<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">내호ˊ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siâ-boe-liàu’e phuê (nai-hó)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">煞<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쇃</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">話<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kâh-kông-boe-soah’e wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">인<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">開<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">完<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">완ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">銃<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">촁</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    īn khūi-boe-oán’e chieng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人去樓空<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.2em\">랑킈`ᄅᅷ캉ˆ</rt></ruby> (<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">火烌猶在<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">훼ˆ후ˉ유ˉ재ˉ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khoà̰-lang-khì-lau-khâng (huê-hū-yū-jāi)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">微微<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">삐삐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">仔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">롷ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hōr bi-bi-â-lôh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">微微<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">삐삐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">仔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">光<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">긍ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thḭ̂ bi-bi-â-kn̂g\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">微微<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">삐삐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">仔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">笑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쵸</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khoà̰-lì bi-bi-â-chio\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">後世人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">ᄋᅷ시`랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재`훼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    au-sì-láng jài-huē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n"
}
